      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Butte%2C_Alaska"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Knik River Public Use Area in Butte offers a full spectrum of outdoor recreation for both motorized and non‑motorized users.",
